  (text "SECURE ELEMENT: Infineon OPTIGA Trust M V3 (SLS32AIA010MK, PG-USON-10 3x3 mm) on its own I2C bus.\nHolds the DWalletCap authority key, gates the storage key behind the PIN, provides device attestation and counters.\nPin-to-pad mapping and the tying of unused pads to ground follow Adafruit's published Trust M breakout (open hardware);\nCONFIRM against the Infineon datasheet, including the footprint's exposed-pad size.\nBus pull-ups are on the MCU sheet. SE_RST_N lets the MCU reset the part."
    (at 20 20 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.8 1.8)
      )
      (justify left top)
    )
    (uuid 013a7b48-6820-517f-904b-a7c7266e2347)
  )
